Pixel art game creature battle sprite, front three-quarter view facing slightly
left, full body, feet grounded. Creature: {name}. Design: {design_brief}.
Colors strictly from these ramps: {palette_rows}.
GBA Pokemon FireRed era style, flat cel shading (base + one shadow + one
